  "cli.proxy.on.short": "Enable proxy in current terminal",
  "cli.proxy.on.long": "Output bash/zsh statements to enable proxy in current terminal (to stdout).\n\nChild processes cannot modify parent shell env, so use eval:\n\n  eval \"$(mihosh on)\"\n\nDefault proxy address derived from mihomo config mixed-port (http://127.0.0.1:<mixed-port>).\nTo change, adjust mixed-port in mihomo config.\nSets: HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY / ALL_PROXY (upper+lower case) + no_proxy.\nIf proxy is already enabled, shows a friendly notice.\n\nBash/zsh only (Linux & macOS).",
  "cli.proxy.off.short": "Disable proxy in current terminal",
  "cli.proxy.off.long": "Output bash/zsh statements to disable proxy in current terminal (to stdout).\n\nChild processes cannot modify parent shell env, so use eval:\n\n  eval \"$(mihosh off)\"\n\nClears HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY / ALL_PROXY / no_proxy (upper+lower case).\nIf proxy is not enabled, shows a friendly notice.\n\nBash/zsh only (Linux & macOS).",

